step	1	-	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Ivy Sophista</col> in <col=800000>Taverley</col>. She told me to speak to <col=800000>Thaerisk</col> about something related to <col=800000>Lucien</col>.</col>
step	2	-	After speaking to Thaerisk
line	<str>I spoke to Ivy Sophista in Taverley. She directed me to Thaerisk, the leader of a group of Guthixians called Crux Eqal. Thaerisk asked me to help deal with the growing threat posed by Lucien. Before he could tell me more, we were attacked by Assassins. However, we were able to defeat them.</str>
line	<col=000080>With the <col=800000>Assassins</col> dealt with, <col=800000>Thaerisk</col> asked me to investigate a treasure hunter called <col=800000>Movario</col> who he believed had worked with <col=800000>Lucien</col>. He suggested I start my search at the <col=800000>Fight Arena</col> as <col=800000>Movario</col> hired a bodyguard from there called <col=800000>Darve</col>.</col>
step	3	-	After speaking to the launderer
line	<str>I spoke to Ivy Sophista in Taverley. She directed me to Thaerisk, the leader of a group of Guthixians called Crux Eqal. Thaerisk asked me to help deal with the growing threat posed by Lucien. Before he could tell me more, we were attacked by Assassins. However, we were able to defeat them.</str>
line	<str>With the Assassins dealt with, Thaerisk asked me to investigate a treasure hunter called Movario who he believed had worked with Lucien. He suggested I start my search at the Fight Arena as Movario hired a bodyguard from there called Darve.</str>
line	<col=000080>I travelled to the <col=800000>Fight Arena</col> and found a <col=800000>Launderer</col> who knew <col=800000>Movario</col>. He gave me a <col=800000>Dirty Shirt</col> belonging to <col=800000>Movario</col> that I might be able to use to track him. However, to do so, I'll need to obtain a <col=800000>Broav</col>. The <col=800000>Launderer</col> suggested I speak to the <col=800000>Hunting Expert</col> in the <col=800000>Feldip Hills</col> about this.</col>
step	4	-	After speaking to the Hunting Expert
line	<str>I spoke to Ivy Sophista in Taverley. She directed me to Thaerisk, the leader of a group of Guthixians called Crux Eqal. Thaerisk asked me to help deal with the growing threat posed by Lucien. Before he could tell me more, we were attacked by Assassins. However, we were able to defeat them.</str>
line	<str>With the Assassins dealt with, Thaerisk asked me to investigate a treasure hunter called Movario who he believed had worked with Lucien. He suggested I start my search at the Fight Arena as Movario hired a bodyguard from there called Darve.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Fight Arena and found a Launderer who knew Movario. He gave me a Dirty Shirt belonging to him and directed me to the Hunting Expert in the Feldip Hills to ask about obtaining a Broav to track Movario with.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke to the <col=800000>Hunting Expert</col> in the <col=800000>Feldip Hills</col> and she told me how to catch a <col=800000>Broav</col>. To do so, I'll need to set up a <col=800000>Pitfall Trap</col> just west of her and bait it with a <col=800000>Mort Myre Fungus</col>.</col>
step	5	-	After the Broav finds the trapdoor
line	<str>I spoke to Ivy Sophista in Taverley. She directed me to Thaerisk, the leader of a group of Guthixians called Crux Eqal. Thaerisk asked me to help deal with the growing threat posed by Lucien. Before he could tell me more, we were attacked by Assassins. However, we were able to defeat them.</str>
line	<str>With the Assassins dealt with, Thaerisk asked me to investigate a treasure hunter called Movario who he believed had worked with Lucien. He suggested I start my search at the Fight Arena as Movario hired a bodyguard from there called Darve.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Fight Arena and found a Launderer who knew Movario. He gave me a Dirty Shirt belonging to him and directed me to the Hunting Expert in the Feldip Hills to ask about obtaining a Broav to track Movario with.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to the Hunting Expert in the Feldip Hills and she showed me how to catch and train a Broav.</str>
line	<col=000080>I returned to the <col=800000>Fight Arena</col> and was able to use my <col=800000>Broav</col> to track <col=800000>Movario's</col> scent to a <col=800000>Hidden Trapdoor</col> in the <col=800000>Khazard Battlefield</col>. I should see where it leads.</col>
step	6	-	After handing Movario's notes to Thaerisk
line	<str>I spoke to Ivy Sophista in Taverley. She directed me to Thaerisk, the leader of a group of Guthixians called Crux Eqal. Thaerisk asked me to help deal with the growing threat posed by Lucien. Before he could tell me more, we were attacked by Assassins. However, we were able to defeat them.</str>
line	<str>With the Assassins dealt with, Thaerisk asked me to investigate a treasure hunter called Movario who he believed had worked with Lucien. He suggested I start my search at the Fight Arena as Movario hired a bodyguard from there called Darve.</str>
