line	<col=000080>I found some <col=800000>Research Notes</col> within the <col=800000>Hidden Base</col> and took them to <col=800000>Thaerisk</col> in <col=800000>Taverley</col>. He then asked me to head to <col=800000>McGrubor's Wood</col> to find <col=800000>Idria</col> and the <col=800000>Guardians of Armadyl</col>, as he'd lost contact with them.</col>
