line	<str>Thaerisk asked me to head to McGrubor's Wood to find Idria and the Guardians of Armadyl, as he'd lost contact with them. Upon arrival, I found them being attacked by some Mercenaries, but I was able to help defeat them.</str>
line	<col=000080>With the <col=800000>Mercenaries</col> dealt with, I gave <col=800000>Idria</col> an update on my recent discoveries. She then departed for the <col=800000>White Knights' Castle</col> in <col=800000>Falador</col>. I should meet up with her and <col=800000>Thaerisk</col> there.</col>
