line	<str>With the Mercenaries dealt with, Idria and I journeyed to the White Knights' Castle in Falador. There we met up with Thaerisk, as well as Akrisae of the Temple Knights.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke with <col=800000>Thaerisk</col>, <col=800000>Akrisae</col> and <col=800000>Idria</col> about the contents of <col=800000>Movario's Research Notes</col>. They revealed <col=800000>Lucien's</col> desire to find and claim an artefact of unimaginable power called the <col=800000>Stone of Jas</col>. To find <col=800000>Lucien</col>, <col=800000>Thaerisk</col> suggested we capture one of his <col=800000>Spies</col> from <col=800000>Draynor Village</col>. <col=800000>Akrisae</col> gave me a <col=800000>Teleorb</col> to plant on one of them.</col>
