step	11	-	After capturing the spy
line	<str>I spoke to Ivy Sophista in Taverley. She directed me to Thaerisk, the leader of a group of Guthixians called Crux Eqal. Thaerisk asked me to help deal with the growing threat posed by Lucien. Before he could tell me more, we were attacked by Assassins. However, we were able to defeat them.</str>
line	<str>With the Assassins dealt with, Thaerisk asked me to investigate a treasure hunter called Movario who he believed had worked with Lucien. He suggested I start my search at the Fight Arena as Movario hired a bodyguard from there called Darve.</str>
line	<str>I travelled to the Fight Arena and found a Launderer who knew Movario. He gave me a Dirty Shirt belonging to him and directed me to the Hunting Expert in the Feldip Hills to ask about obtaining a Broav to track Movario with.</str>
line	<str>I spoke to the Hunting Expert in the Feldip Hills and she showed me how to catch and train a Broav.</str>
line	<str>I returned to the Fight Arena and was able to use my Broav to track Movario's scent to a Hidden Base below the Khazard Battlefield.</str>
line	<str>I found some Research Notes within the Hidden Base and took them to Thaerisk in Taverley.</str>
line	<str>Thaerisk asked me to head to McGrubor's Wood to find Idria and the Guardians of Armadyl, as he'd lost contact with them. Upon arrival, I found them being attacked by some Mercenaries, but I was able to help defeat them.</str>
line	<str>With the Mercenaries dealt with, Idria and I journeyed to the White Knights' Castle in Falador. There we met up with Thaerisk, as well as Akrisae of the Temple Knights.</str>
line	<str>I spoke with Thaerisk, Akrisae and Idria about the contents of Movario's Research Notes. They revealed Lucien's desire to find and claim an artefact of unimaginable power called the Stone of Jas.</str>
line	<str>To find Lucien, Thaerisk suggested we capture one of his Spies from Draynor Village. As such, I planted a Teleorb given to me by Akrisae on one of them. He then used this Teleorb to teleport the Spy into a cell.</str>
line	<col=000080>With the <col=800000>Spy</col> captured, we attempted to interrogate him using some <col=800000>Truth Serum</col>. However, the <col=800000>Spy</col> was able to destroy it. To make some more, we'll need some <col=800000>Enriched Snapdragon</col>. <col=800000>Thaerisk</col> asked me to take a <col=800000>Snapdragon Seed</col> to <col=800000>Betty</col> in <col=800000>Port Sarim</col> to get it enriched. If needed, <col=800000>Thaerisk</col> can sell me a <col=800000>Snapdragon Seed</col> for a reduced price.</col>
