line	<str>I spoke to Ivy Sophista in Taverley. She directed me to Thaerisk, the leader of a group of Guthixians called Crux Eqal. Thaerisk asked me to help deal with the growing threat posed by Lucien. Before he could tell me more, we were attacked by Assassins. However, we were able to defeat them.</str>
