line	<str>To make some more Truth Serum, I prepared an Enriched Snapdragon Seed and planted it in a Specially Prepared Patch on the roof of the White Knights' Castle. While waiting for it to grow, I recruited Turael, Mazchna, Duradel and Cyrisus to our cause.</str>
line	<col=000080>I harvested the <col=800000>Enriched Snapdragon</col> from the <col=800000>Specially Prepared Patch</col> on the roof of the <col=800000>White Knights' Castle</col>. I should now be able to use it to make some new <col=800000>Truth Serum</col>. I should speak to <col=800000>Thaerisk</col> about how to do this.</col>
