line	<str>I harvested the Enriched Snapdragon and used it to make some new Truth Serum. I then administered the Truth Serum to the Spy and he provided details on an individual known as the Dark Squall.</str>
line	<col=000080>Based on the information provided, <col=800000>Idria</col> and <col=800000>Akrisae</col> initiated a search for the <col=800000>Dark Squall</col>. <col=800000>Idria</col> then asked me to recruit three more heroes for our cause. All of them can be found in the <col=800000>Warriors' Guild</col>.</col>
line	
line	<col=000080>I still need to recruit the following people:</col>
line	<col=800000>Harrallak Menarous</col>
line	<col=800000>Ghommal</col>
