line	<str>Thaerisk asked me to head to McGrubor's Wood to find Idria and the Guardians of Armadyl, as he'd lost contact with them. Upon arrival, I found them being attacked by some Mercenaries, but I was able to help defeat them.</str>
line	<str>With the Mercenaries dealt with, Idria and I journeyed to the White Knights' Castle in Falador. There we met up with Thaerisk, as well as Akrisae of the Temple Knights.</str>
line	<str>I spoke with Thaerisk, Akrisae and Idria about the contents of Movario's Research Notes. They revealed Lucien's desire to find and claim an artefact of unimaginable power called the Stone of Jas.</str>
line	<str>To find Lucien, Thaerisk suggested we capture one of his Spies from Draynor Village. As such, I planted a Teleorb given to me by Akrisae on one of them. He then used this Teleorb to teleport the Spy into a cell.</str>
line	<str>With the Spy captured, we attempted to interrogate him using some Truth Serum. However, the Spy was able to destroy it.</str>
line	<str>To make some more Truth Serum, I prepared an Enriched Snapdragon Seed and planted it in a Specially Prepared Patch on the roof of the White Knights' Castle. While waiting for it to grow, I recruited Turael, Mazchna, Duradel and Cyrisus to our cause.</str>
line	<str>I harvested the Enriched Snapdragon and used it to make some new Truth Serum. I then administered the Truth Serum to the Spy and he provided details on an individual known as the Dark Squall.</str>
line	<str>Based on the information provided, Idria and Akrisae initiated a search for the Dark Squall. I then recruited Harrallak Menarous, Ghommal and Sloane to our cause. However, while discussing our next steps, Hazelmere arrived and volunteered to join us as well.</str>
line	<col=000080>I spoke to <col=800000>Akrisae</col> and he told me there had been a possible sighting of the <col=800000>Dark Squall</col> at the <col=800000>Black Knights' Fortress</col>. He sent <col=800000>Silif</col> to investigate, but lost contact with him. I should head to the <col=800000>Black Knights' Fortress</col> myself to find both <col=800000>Silif</col> and the <col=800000>Dark Squall</col>.</col>
