line	<str>I spoke to Akrisae and he told me there had been a possible sighting of the Dark Squall at the Black Knights' Fortress. He sent Silif to investigate, but lost contact with him. I travelled to the Black Knights' Fortress myself to investigate. I found Silif imprisoned in some Catacombs beneath the Fortress.</str>
line	<col=000080>I managed to free <col=800000>Silif</col> from his imprisonment in the <col=800000>Black Knight Catacombs</col>, but he's in a bad state. I should see what I can do to help him.</col>
