line	<col=000080>Although the situation is dire, all may not yet be lost. According to <col=800000>Akrisae</col>, <col=800000>Movario</col> was spotted entering a cavern full of <col=800000>Floating Lights</col> in the <col=800000>Lumbridge Swamp Caves</col>. If I can find the <col=800000>Stone of Jas</col> before he does, I might still be able to stop <col=800000>Lucien</col> from getting it. I should disguise myself as the <col=800000>Dark Squall</col> and meet with <col=800000>Movario</col> to find out what he knows.</col>
