line	<col=000080>I found <col=800000>Movario</col> in the <col=800000>Lumbridge Swamp Caves</col>. By disguising myself as the <col=800000>Dark Squall</col>, I managed to convince him that I was there to help him find the <col=800000>Stone of Jas</col>. <col=800000>Movario</col> believes the <col=800000>Stone</col> to be at the bottom of a <col=800000>Large Chasm</col>, but he hasn't been able to find a way down. I suggested we use one of the nearby <col=800000>Light Creatures</col>. When I'm ready, I should use a <col=800000>Sapphire Lantern</col> to attract one.</col>
